      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "P - Population: Hospitals (Primary, Secondary, Tertiary, private, and specialty). I - Intervention: Accredited healthcare organization. C - Comparison: Not applicable. O - Outcomes: Quality, Patient safety, organizational performance. S - Study Design: Quantitative, qualitative, and mixed-method studies.",
      "reason": "The manuscript explicitly reports PICO(S) components (population, intervention, comparison, outcomes, study designs) and specifies hospital settings and eligible study designs used to determine eligibility."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "A comprehensive literature search was performed in the following databases: PubMed, Scopus, Embase, Medline, and Science Direct, from 2014 to 2024... Peer-reviewed journals should be in English and published between 2014 and 2024. Studies will be excluded if they meet the following criteria: ... Limited to editorials, commentaries, opinion pieces. Non-English articles and manuscripts without fulltext articles were excluded.",
