    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "The narrative synthesis followed Synthesis Without Meta-Analyses (SWiM) reporting principles... summarising direction of effect, vote-counting based on direction, and key contextual moderators (income setting, accreditation body, hospital type). ... Subgroup analyses by income setting (high-income vs. low-and middle-income) and accreditation body (JCI vs. national) were planned a priori.",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies how studies were grouped for synthesis (e.g., by income setting, accreditation body, hospital type) and links these groups to planned comparisons and synthesis approaches."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
